  "notes": {
    "raw": "\\*Data above 298 K estimated. \nPhase change: 700 K, $\\alpha - \\beta$ transition point of Co; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 0.108$ kcal/mol. \nHeat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations: \n$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} 2 9 8. 1 5 - 9 0 0 \\mathrm{K}: & \\mathrm{Cp} ^ {\\circ} = 3 6. 6 0 1 + 1 9. 7 2 4 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} - 3. 2 1 1 \\times 1 0 ^ {5} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 2} \\\\ & \\mathrm{H} ^ {\\circ} - \\mathrm{H} _ {2 9 8} ^ {\\circ} = 3 6. 6 0 1 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} + 9. 8 6 2 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 3. 2 1 1 \\times 1 0 ^ {2} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 1 2. 8 6 6 \\end{array}\n$$\nReaction equations (kcal/mol): \n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} 2 9 8. 1 5 - 7 0 0 \\mathrm{K}: \\quad \\Delta \\mathrm{Hr} ^ {\\circ} = - 1 4 9. 5 3 2 + 4. 9 1 2 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} + 3. 8 9 1 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 1 4 9. 7 0 0 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} \\\\ \\Delta G r ^ {\\circ} = - 1 4 9. 5 3 2 - 4. 9 1 2 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{TlnT} - 3. 8 9 1 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 7 4. 8 5 0 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} + 1 2 4. 5 6 3 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} \\\\ 7 0 0 - 9 0 0 \\mathrm{K}: \\quad \\Delta \\mathrm{Hr} ^ {\\circ} = - 1 6 9. 1 2 8 + 3 0. 3 7 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} - 7. 0 2 3 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 4 9 0 8. 9 0 0 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} \\\\ \\Delta G r ^ {\\circ} = - 1 6 9. 1 2 8 - 3 0. 3 7 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{TlnT} + 7. 0 2 3 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 2 4 5 4. 4 5 0 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} + 3 0 6. 8 3 8 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$\nSources: Enthalpy of formation at 298 K from Mills (80). Low-temperature heat capacities and entropy at 298 K from Stuve (113). Data above 298 K estimated. ",
    "lines_raw": [
      "\\*Data above 298 K estimated.",
      "Phase change: 700 K, $\\alpha - \\beta$ transition point of Co; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 0.108$ kcal/mol.",
